# Example fragment — copy to <name>.config to enable.
#
# Layout: fragments/common/*.config applies to every branch,
# fragments/<our_branch>/*.config (e.g. android14-6.1-stable/) to one family.
# Files merge sorted; remove a file to stop applying it.
#
# Rules: blank lines, # comments, CONFIG_X=value, or # CONFIG_X is not set.
# Symbols already effective in gki_defconfig are skipped (dedup).
#
# NOTE: this file ends in .example so it is never loaded. Copy it:
#   cp example.config.example bbr.config
#
# e.g. TCP BBR congestion control:
# CONFIG_TCP_CONG_BBR=y
#
# e.g. explicitly disable something:
# # CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO is not set
